### Login para obter token
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### Variables (ajuste após login)
@access_token = token_aqui
@doc_id = 1
@anexo_id = 1

### Listar tipos de documentos
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/documentos/tipos
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Criar documento
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/documentos/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo_documento_id": 1,
  "nome": "Documento de Teste",
  "registro": "123456",
  "outras_informacoes": "Observações"
}

### Listar documentos
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/documentos?page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Upload anexos (substitua {{doc_id}})
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/documentos/{{doc_id}}/anexos
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="teste.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./teste.pdf
--MyBoundary--

### Listar anexos
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/documentos/{{doc_id}}/anexos
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Baixar primeiro anexo
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/documentos/{{doc_id}}/anexos/{{anexo_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
